sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (Browser)
    participant R as React App
    participant F as FastAPI
    participant S as BookingService
    participant P as PricingService
    participant Repo as Repositories
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>R: Click "Book this flight"
    R->>R: Navigate to /booking/:id
    R->>F: GET /api/flights/:id/seats
    F->>S: seat_service.get_aircraft_seats()
    S->>Repo: seat_repo.get_by_aircraft()
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM seats WHERE aircraft_id = ?
    DB-->>Repo: rows
    Repo-->>S: Seat objects
    Note over S,P: Each seat's price<br/>uses class multiplier<br/>(Economy 1× / Business 2.5×)
    S-->>F: seats + availability + prices
    F-->>R: JSON response
    R-->>U: Show seat map

    U->>R: Pick seat + Continue
    R->>F: POST /api/bookings {flight_id, seat_id}
    F->>S: booking_service.create_booking()
    S->>Repo: validate passenger, flight, seat
    S->>Repo: check seat availability
    S->>Repo: create booking (status=UNPAID)
    Note over S: fare_amount comes from<br/>flight.base_fare (already<br/>ML-priced at generation)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO bookings ...
    DB-->>Repo: booking id
    Repo-->>S: Booking object
    S-->>F: Booking
    F-->>R: 201 Created {booking}
    R-->>U: Redirect to /payment/:bookingId

    U->>R: Submit payment
    R->>F: POST /api/payments {booking_id, card...}
    F->>S: payment_service.process_payment()
    S-->>F: PaymentResult(success=true)
    F->>S: booking_service.mark_as_paid()
    S->>Repo: update booking.status = CONFIRMED
    Repo->>DB: UPDATE bookings SET status = 'CONFIRMED'
    F-->>R: 200 OK {success, transaction_id}
    R-->>U: Redirect to /confirmation/:bookingId